{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "en",
  "language_raw": "English",
  "source": "message/dat/English/script/ajito_doku_040.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/English/script/ajito_doku_040.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_00",
      "hash64": "7EE9C25EC927EBA9",
      "text": "Forgive me, my friends...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "F1B3A41EED808681",
      "text": "About a year and a half ago...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "7EE9C15EC927E9F6",
      "text": "Forgive me. It took a goodly time to procure\\nthe required materials.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_honooboss_01",
      "hash64": "3FEE639A2D55390C",
      "text": "Whoaaa, sick! These boots are insaaaaaane![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_02",
      "hash64": "7EE9C05EC927E843",
      "text": "Ah, yes. The move Flame Charge was my muse\\nfor those particular pieces.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_kakutouboss_01",
      "hash64": "4918872BA1141559",
      "text": "This outfit is everything I imagined it would be.\\nThank you so much![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_03",
      "hash64": "7EE9BF5EC927E690",
      "text": "I merely wished to create a costume worthy of\\nthe great Infernal Eri. If it aligns with your vision,\\r\\nthen I am content.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_01",
      "hash64": "36523EDB08117B0C",
      "text": "Seems our outfit upgrades are all wrapped up,\\nthen! Thanks a ton, Atticus.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_02",
      "hash64": "365241DB08118025",
      "text": "With you two lookin’ like absolute beasts,\\nanyone who crosses us will be sweatin’ bullets![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "0E1DF61F5DCB6AEA",
      "text": "You’re so good at these sorts of crafty things,\\nAtticus.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_fairyboss_02",
      "hash64": "0E1DF51F5DCB6937",
      "text": "Those people bullying you ’cause you geek out\\nover old-fashioned stuff are out of their minds.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_04",
      "hash64": "7EE9C65EC927F275",
      "text": "The way of the ninja is rough and fraught with\\nthorns. I neither expect nor desire sympathy from\\r\\nthe unrefined rabble.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_honooboss_02",
      "hash64": "3FEE669A2D553E25",
      "text": "Oooh, someone’s gettin’ fired up! Watch out,\\nworld—our Atticus has FIGHTIN’ words![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_kakutouboss_02",
      "hash64": "4918842BA1141040",
      "text": "Yeah, don’t listen to the haters, Atticus. I think\\nyou’re really cool![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_03",
      "hash64": "365240DB08117E72",
      "text": "All right, gang. Let’s move on to the next step.\\c\\nIt’s time to put our backs into our battle training\\nso we’re all prepped for Operation Star.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_akuboss_04",
      "hash64": "36523BDB081175F3",
      "text": "We gotta be stronger than everyone else in the\\nteam—that’s what bein’ a boss means![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_05",
      "hash64": "7EE9C55EC927F0C2",
      "text": "Indeed it does. Henceforth, I will devote myself\\nheart and soul to honing my battle skills![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_06",
      "hash64": "7EE9C45EC927EF0F",
      "text": "For the sake of the team, I would give my very\\nheart and soul...but I cannot defy the rules.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_07",
      "hash64": "7EE9C35EC927ED5C",
      "text": "Our code must be obeyed.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_08",
      "hash64": "7EE9CA5EC927F941",
      "text": "And so...this badge is mine to keep no more.\\nI entrust it to thy care.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_waza_01",
      "hash64": "D28430A2470ED9B9",
      "text": "Take this contraption, too. It contains a technique\\nthat allows one to cover their foes in gunk.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_09",
      "hash64": "7EE9C95EC927F78E",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0100(0000)] is thy name,\\nis it not?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_10",
      "hash64": "7EE63C5EC924D220",
      "text": "You have utterly bested me. But thy victory stir’d\\nno bitterness within me—such was its brilliance.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_01",
      "hash64": "E6637BEF86A2512B",
      "text": "Don Atticus!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_11",
      "hash64": "7EE63D5EC924D3D3",
      "text": "M-my compadre?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "BD2F1C2F0598E27F",
      "text": "It seems this little fella has been dying to speak\\nwith you face-to-face.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_02",
      "hash64": "E6637CEF86A252DE",
      "text": "Don Atticus, please, hear what I have to say!\\nI only need a moment!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_12",
      "hash64": "7EE63E5EC924D586",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "BD2F1D2F0598E432",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_13",
      "hash64": "7EE63F5EC924D739",
      "text": "Whatever brought you all the way here?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_03",
      "hash64": "E6637DEF86A25491",
      "text": "I came to help you!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_04",
      "hash64": "E6637EEF86A25644",
      "text": "If you don’t start going to class again, you’ll be\\nexpelled from the academy, right?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_14",
      "hash64": "7EE6405EC924D8EC",
      "text": "... ... ...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_05",
      "hash64": "E6637FEF86A257F7",
      "text": "When the other kids at school and I were getting\\nbullied real bad, you and the rest of Team Star\\r\\nsaved us!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_06",
      "hash64": "E66380EF86A259AA",
      "text": "Thanks to that operation you carried out,\\nwe were all able to go to school again!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_07",
      "hash64": "E66381EF86A25B5D",
      "text": "If you got expelled for being the good guys,\\nthat’d be the worst thing ever!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_15",
      "hash64": "7EE6415EC924DA9F",
      "text": "Forgive me...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_08",
      "hash64": "E66372EF86A241E0",
      "text": "Haven’t you heard anything from the big boss...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_16",
      "hash64": "7EE6425EC924DC52",
      "text": "Nay, we’ve heard not a whisper since that\\nfateful day...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_17",
      "hash64": "7EE6435EC924DE05",
      "text": "Without the big boss, Team Star cannot carry on.\\c\\nAnd without the team, the bright and merry\\nstudent life we seek lies beyond our reach![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_18",
      "hash64": "7EE6445EC924DFB8",
      "text": "We’ve no choice but to defend our bases till\\nthe big boss returns to us![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_09",
      "hash64": "E66373EF86A24393",
      "text": "You evidently trust this big boss of yours a great\\ndeal. Who exactly are they?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
