    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_20",
      "hash64": "7EF04E5EC92D453B",
      "text": "In truth, not one of us has met them in the flesh.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_11",
      "hash64": "E666FFEF86A5674E",
      "text": "[EMPTY 61]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_21",
      "hash64": "7EF04D5EC92D4388",
      "text": "By their own word, they are a recluse. As with the\\nrest of us, ’twould seem bullying was to blame.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_12",
      "hash64": "E666FEEF86A5659B",
      "text": "That’s awful...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_22",
      "hash64": "7EF0505EC92D48A1",
      "text": "Though their name and face be unknown to us,\\nthey are nonetheless our precious comrade.\\c\\nOur only choice is to maintain our vigils from\\nthe bases, awaiting the day of their return.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 182,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_13",
      "hash64": "E666FDEF86A563E8",
      "text": "So that’s why you don’t go to school...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_student_14",
      "hash64": "E66704EF86A56FCD",
      "text": "But...but still! Don’t ever think that Team Star is\\nall you have, Don Atticus!\\c\\nYou’ve got a lifelong compadre in me—and don’t\\nyou forget it!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_doku_040_dokuboss_23",
      "hash64": "7EF04F5EC92D46EE",
      "text": "My compadre...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
